## 1. Visit completion & cancellation

This release adds **CRM authentication** on the visit update endpoint (`X-CRM-Key`). The OpenHouse mobile app uses the same URL with a session token; CRM uses `X-CRM-Key` instead — both paths are independent.

### Endpoint

```http
PUT /schedule-visits/{visit_id}/
```

**Example:**  
`https://staging-561394753846.asia-south2.run.app/api/v1/oh/schedule-visits/123/`

### Required in every request

Always send the visit’s current **`selected_date`** and **`selected_time`** (same values as stored on the visit). This matches how the app calls the API.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|-------|------|--------|
| `selected_date` | string | `YYYY-MM-DD` |
| `selected_time` | string | e.g. `"1 - 3 PM"`, `"10:00 AM"` |
| `status` | string | `"completed"` or `"cancelled"` |

### Completion paths

The backend detects the path from the payload (same logic as the OpenHouse app).

#### A. OTP visit completed

Use when the visit was completed via OTP — **sales feedback only**, no structured SM form.

```json
{
  "selected_date": "2025-07-23",
  "selected_time": "1 - 3 PM",
  "status": "completed",
  "sales_feedback": "Visit completed via OTP. Buyer will follow up next week."
}
```

#### B. Assisted visit completed

Use when the sales manager filled the full feedback form — includes **`lead_status`** and **`sm_demand_feedback`**.

```json
{
  "selected_date": "2025-07-23",
  "selected_time": "1 - 3 PM",
  "status": "completed",
  "lead_status": "hot",
  "sales_feedback": "Strong interest; asked about token and timeline.",
  "sm_demand_feedback": {
    "time_spent_on_site": "20 - 30 min",
    "society_amenity_tour": "Full amenity tour",
    "price_discussion": "Yes",
    "client_queries": "Asked multiple questions",
    "closing_signal": "Asked about booking / token / timeline",
    "buyer_primary_concern": "Price too high"
  }
}
```

**`lead_status` allowed values:**  
`hot`, `warm`, `cold`, `future_prospect`, `dead`, `select_status`

**Suggested values for `sm_demand_feedback` fields** (aligned with the app):

| Field | Example values |
|-------|----------------|
| `time_spent_on_site` | `Less than 5 min`, `5 - 10 min`, `10 - 15 min`, `15 - 20 min`, `20 - 30 min`, `30 - 50 min`, `50+ min` |
| `society_amenity_tour` | `Skipped`, `Quick walk-through`, `Full amenity tour`, `Detailed tour & society enquiry` |
| `price_discussion` | `No`, `Yes` |
| `client_queries` | `No — didn't ask`, `Casually asked 1 aspect`, `Asked multiple questions`, `Deep probing & compared` |
| `closing_signal` | `Non-committal — "will think about it"`, `Asked for brochure / floor plan`, `Wants revisit or comparison visit`, `Asked about booking / token / timeline` |
| `buyer_primary_concern` | Optional — e.g. `Price too high`, `Location not preferred`, `No concern expressed` |

#### C. Cancel visit

```json
{
  "selected_date": "2025-07-23",
  "selected_time": "1 - 3 PM",
  "status": "cancelled"
}
```

### Behaviour after CRM complete/cancel

| Field | Value when CRM calls |
|-------|----------------------|
| `platform` | `"crm"` |
| `status` | `"completed"` or `"cancelled"` |

When the mobile app completes/cancels the same visit, `platform` is set to `"app"`. This indicates **where the action was performed**, not where the visit was originally scheduled.

### Success response

- **HTTP `200 OK`**
- Body contains the updated visit object (fields may be **camelCase** in JSON, e.g. `selectedDate`, `salesFeedback`, `leadStatus`, `platform`).

Important response fields:

| Field | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `id` | Visit ID |
| `status` | `completed` / `cancelled` / `upcoming` |
| `platform` | `crm` after CRM complete/cancel |
| `lead_status` | Lead intent (assisted path) |
| `sales_feedback` | Free-text SM notes |
| `demand_sm_feedback` | Structured feedback object (assisted path) |

### Errors

| HTTP status | When |
|-------------|------|
| `401` | Missing/invalid `X-CRM-Key` |
| `404` | Visit ID not found |
| `400` | Invalid payload / validation error |

### cURL examples

**OTP complete:**

```bash
curl -X PUT \
  'https://staging-561394753846.asia-south2.run.app/api/v1/oh/schedule-visits/123/' \
  -H 'X-CRM-Key: <CRM_API_KEY>' \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "selected_date": "2025-07-23",
    "selected_time": "1 - 3 PM",
    "status": "completed",
    "sales_feedback": "Test OTP complete from CRM"
  }'
```

**Assisted complete:**

```bash
curl -X PUT \
  'https://staging-561394753846.asia-south2.run.app/api/v1/oh/schedule-visits/123/' \
  -H 'X-CRM-Key: <CRM_API_KEY>' \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "selected_date": "2025-07-23",
    "selected_time": "1 - 3 PM",
    "status": "completed",
    "lead_status": "hot",
    "sales_feedback": "Assisted visit complete from CRM",
    "sm_demand_feedback": {
      "time_spent_on_site": "20 - 30 min",
      "society_amenity_tour": "Full amenity tour",
      "price_discussion": "Yes",
      "client_queries": "Asked multiple questions",
      "closing_signal": "Asked about booking / token / timeline",
      "buyer_primary_concern": "Price too high"
    }
  }'
```

